   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "When is «sein» used in the Plusquamperfekt?",
     "texto": [
      "Intransitive verbs expressing movement or change of place (**gehen, fahren, fliegen, ankommen, abfahren, umziehen**) or a change of state (**einschlafen, aufwachen, sterben, wachsen**), as well as **sein** and **bleiben**, form their compound tenses with the auxiliary **sein**.",
      "In the Plusquamperfekt this auxiliary is conjugated in the Präteritum (**ich war, du warst, er/sie/es war, wir waren, ihr wart, sie/Sie waren**):",
      "**Als wir am Bahnhof ankamen, war der Zug bereits abgefahren** (when we arrived at the station, the train had already left).",
      "**Sie war schon eingeschlafen, bevor der Film zu Ende war** (she had already fallen asleep before the film ended)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
